{"quest_id": 6963, "name": "お菓子工場への道", "description": "チョコが魔物になる原因を突き止めるべく\n工場へ向かう一行に対し、デーモンシェフ\nなる謎の存在から刺客が放たれる。\n中級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃8体）", "event": "デーモンシェフのお菓子工場", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920138, "map_no": 3485, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 25, "exp": 200, "gold": 850, "drops": [{"card": 19, "c": 1}, {"card": 72, "c": 2}, {"item": 1001, "c": 1}, {"item": 5002, "c": 1}, {"card": 1654, "c": 1}], "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 20, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "attack": 140, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 140, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097200, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 3, "spawn_sec": 2}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 6, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1000, "attack": 150, "base_hp": 1000, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 16, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 53, "move_speed": 1300.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097184, "race_id": 11, "master_id": 2, "spawn_sec": 43}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 11, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_range": 140, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 171, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2098016, "race_id": 9, "missile_id": 9, "missile": {"speed": 3.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 68, "global_id": 67, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 45}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 900, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 900, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 153, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097360, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 16, "spawn_sec": 57}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 7, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1200, "attack": 250, "base_hp": 1200, "base_attack": 250, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_range": 160, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 1800.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2098240, "race_id": 9, "missile_id": 15, "missile": {"speed": 2.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 76, "global_id": 75, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 62}, {"enemy_id": 6, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 5000, "attack": 400, "base_hp": 5000, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 156, "move_speed": 370.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097792, "master_id": 9, "spawn_sec": 89}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "ゴブリン", "text": "ギャギャ　チョコオイシイ！\nトロトロアマアマ！", "face": "l07267ed6c1ce"}, {"name": "ゴブリン", "text": "王子タチ　ジャマスル　チョコモラエル！\nデーモンシェフ　ヤサシイ！", "face": "l07267ed6c1ce"}, {"name": "セブン", "text": "――へぇ、デーモンシェフだって？\nもう少し詳しく話を聞かせてくれよ。", "face": "u449"}, {"name": "ゴブリン", "text": "ギャギャ！？", "face": "l07267ed6c1ce"}, {"name": "ソフィー", "text": "『お菓子工場』に向かう道中に\nやけに魔物が多いと思えば……。", "face": "u746"}, {"name": "アリス", "text": "なるほど、化け化け情報網で聞いたとおり、\nデーモンシェフなる魔物が、\nゴブリンを雇って私達を妨害していたんですね！", "face": "u589"}, {"name": "シャルキー", "text": "この街道は商人さん達も使う流通の要です。\nお菓子を悪用する魔物に、\n占拠なんて絶対させませんから！", "face": "u965"}, {"name": "ゴブリン", "text": "ギャギャ！　オウジタチ！　キタ！\nセントウジュンビ！　ジュンビー！！", "face": "l07267ed6c1ce"}, {"name": "シャルキー", "text": "王子様、この道を抜けないと、\n『お菓子工場』にはたどり着けません。\nずばばっとやっつけちゃいましょう！", "face": "u965"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "ゴブリン", "text": "ギャギャ！　テッタイ！　テッタイ！\nデーモンシェフ　ホウコク！！", "face": "l07267ed6c1ce"}, {"name": "シャルキー", "text": "でーもんしぇふ……。\nいったい何者なのでしょうか……。", "face": "u965"}, {"name": "エーテル", "text": "……デーモンに、工場に、動き出すお菓子。\n何だか嫌な予感がしますね……。", "face": "u215"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "ともかく、これで先へ進めるようになりました。\n一刻も早く『お菓子工場』に向かいましょう！", "face": "lff330ed655d9"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map920138_3485", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 931, "y": 493}, {"k": "m", "x": 237, "y": 421, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 381, "y": 282, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 508, "y": 132, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 540, "y": 305, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 491, "y": 373, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 482, "y": 222, "id": 205}, {"k": "m", "x": 733, "y": 376, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 786, "y": 477, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 375, "y": 184, "id": 208}, {"k": "m", "x": 414, "y": 91, "id": 209}, {"k": "m", "x": 690, "y": 443, "id": 210}, {"k": "m", "x": 586, "y": 406, "id": 211}, {"k": "m", "x": 637, "y": 339, "id": 212}, {"k": "m", "x": 131, "y": 467, "id": 213}, {"k": "m", "x": 336, "y": 383, "id": 214}, {"k": "m", "x": 828, "y": 411, "id": 215}, {"k": "r", "x": 187, "y": 181, "id": 300}, {"k": "r", "x": 655, "y": 130, "id": 301}, {"k": "r", "x": 311, "y": 98, "id": 302}, {"k": "r", "x": 622, "y": 260, "id": 303}, {"k": "r", "x": 285, "y": 160, "id": 304}, {"k": "r", "x": 447, "y": 434, "id": 305}, {"k": "r", "x": 152, "y": 344, "id": 306}, {"k": "r", "x": 527, "y": 454, "id": 307}, {"k": "r", "x": 224, "y": 335, "id": 308}, {"k": "r", "x": 604, "y": 477, "id": 309}, {"k": "r", "x": 585, "y": 175, "id": 310}, {"k": "r", "x": 794, "y": 302, "id": 311}, {"k": "r", "x": 288, "y": 249, "id": 312}, {"k": "r", "x": 347, "y": 468, "id": 313}, {"k": "r", "x": 110, "y": 282, "id": 314}]}, "start_cost": 10, "active": true, "story_talk": true}